  "workspaceId": "__WORKSPACE_ID__",
  "dataSourceInstructions": "## Telemetry (KQL database)\n- EquipmentTelemetry holds live sensor readings, one row per tag per second, kept for 7 days.\n- \"Right now\" or \"currently\" means the last 15 minutes. \"Latest reading\" means arg_max(event_time, *) per tag_id.\n- anomaly_type is \"BearingWear\" during a fault episode and \"None\" otherwise.\n- tag_id and tag_number identify the equipment, the same values as Equipment in the maintenance model.",
